---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  pageTitle="Privacy Policy | MAUI Day"
  pageDescription="Privacy policy for the MAUI Day website and mobile apps."
>
  <section class="bg-white text-gray-600 text-md py-40">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-brand-dark text-4xl font-header font-bold mb-8">
          MAUI Day Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4">
          Last updated: 18 July 2026
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-8">
          This policy explains how MAUI Day handles data for both the MAUI Day website and the MAUI Day companion app on iOS and Android (bundle/app id: net.mauiday.companion).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-brand-dark text-2xl font-header font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Mobile App(s)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-4">
          The MAUI Day mobile app does not collect, store, or share personal data.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 space-y-2 mb-8 text-gray-700 text-base leading-6">
          <li>No account is required.</li>
          <li>No analytics or advertising trackers are used.</li>
          <li>No location, contacts, photos, microphone, or camera data is collected.</li>
          <li>No personal data is sold or shared with third parties.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-8">
          The app fetches public, non-personal event data (such as schedule and speakers) over HTTPS and caches it locally on your device for offline use.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-brand-dark text-2xl font-header font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Website and Newsletter</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-8">
          On the MAUI Day website, if you subscribe to the newsletter, we process your name and email address to send MAUI Day updates. You can unsubscribe at any time through the link in each email.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-4">
          The website newsletter form uses Google reCAPTCHA to prevent spam. Google may process technical information as part of that service.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 space-y-2 mb-8 text-gray-700 text-base leading-6">
          <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-extra hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-extra hover:underline">Google Terms of Service</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-brand-dark text-2xl font-header font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-8">
          We may update this policy if the app's data practices change. Updates will be published on this page.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-brand-dark text-2xl font-header font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-md text-base mb-8">
          If you have questions about this policy, please contact the organisers via the details listed on this site.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
